  <acqinfo id="75853ce18bd3ccb99437e4ce2b96250a">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>Ford Foundation archive was deposited at the RAC in 2011. Ford Foundation records, correspondence, reports, program files, and officers' papers were transferred to and accessioned by the RAC beginning in 2011. Accessions continue as necessary.   </p><p>This material was transferred to the RAC as part of two larger accessions in 2021. These accessions were ingested by the RAC as Accessions 2021:020 and 2021:134.</p>  </acqinfo>
